  "reasoning": "The facts show that the defendant possessed a bird gun and a hunting rifle, both firearms powered by gunpowder, without legal authorization. Under Chinese criminal law, unauthorized possession of firearms, ammunition, or other controlled dangerous items constitutes the offense of illegal possession of firearms, formally labeled as “非法持有枪支、弹药、管制刀具、危险物品危及公共安全”. No other criminal conduct (e.g., use, trafficking, or endangerment) is described, so only this charge applies.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法持有枪支、弹药、管制刀具、危险物品危及公共安全<eoa>"
